$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=korseltlem1  LOC_AFTER=?

* Lemma for korselt: at a prime P with ( P - 1 ) || ( N - 1 ), the P-adic
  valuation of the squarefree N is at most that of A ^ N - A.

1::simp1    |- ( ( P e. Prime /\ ( N e. NN /\ ( mmu ` N ) =/= 0 ) /\ ( ( P - 1 ) || ( N - 1 ) /\ A e. ZZ ) ) -> P e. Prime )
