9:2:nnnn0d  |- ( ( P e. Prime /\ ( N e. NN /\ ( mmu ` N ) =/= 0 ) /\ ( ( P - 1 ) || ( N - 1 ) /\ A e. ZZ ) ) -> N e. NN0 )
